    "note_tweet": {
      "entities": {},
      "text": "hey RJ — hope you don’t mind some Android feedback! I use ChatGPT on Android a lot and two client-side issues have been pretty persistent for me: formulas sometimes render scrambled/broken, and really long conversations get painfully laggy.\n\nalso occasionally Pro/Extended Thinking finishes thinking but never renders the final answer 😭\n\nI’ve sent this through support already, but happy to send screenshots / examples if any of this is useful to the Android team."
